{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Monetary Lever",
    "steam_appid": 3495290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a monetary policy sim  that allows the player to control the interest rate and level of quantitative easing/tightening set by the Bank of England and see the effect this has on the British economy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495290/extras/55412992a6f873e7c092f7116298c9e3.avif?t=1741888898\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can pick between the main game mode in which players must keep the British Economy from collapsing whilst making sure inflation remains within the Bank of England targets of 2% +/- 1% otherwise the player will be fired this allows players to try and beat their high scores and try to remain in power for as long as possible. Or the other game mode is Endless mode where it is impossible for the player to be fired and is thus able to experiment and tamper with interest rates and QE/QT as much as they want and see the effects of their measures on the British economy.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495290/extras/f604f4af5f40b612c426e4ca79634770.avif?t=1741888898\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Economic Model:</strong> Experience the real-world challenges of balancing economic growth with inflation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Gameplay:</strong> Easy-to-understand controls make it accessible to players of all levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Visualizations:</strong> Track key economic indicators with clear and informative graphs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Government Response:</strong> The government implements fiscal policy measures (e.g., spending, taxation) in response to economic conditions, adding another layer of complexity and realism to the simulation.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a monetary policy sim  that allows the player to control the interest rate and level of quantitative easing/tightening set by the Bank of England and see the effect this has on the British economy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495290/extras/55412992a6f873e7c092f7116298c9e3.avif?t=1741888898\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can pick between the main game mode in which players must keep the British Economy from collapsing whilst making sure inflation remains within the Bank of England targets of 2% +/- 1% otherwise the player will be fired this allows players to try and beat their high scores and try to remain in power for as long as possible. Or the other game mode is Endless mode where it is impossible for the player to be fired and is thus able to experiment and tamper with interest rates and QE/QT as much as they want and see the effects of their measures on the British economy.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495290/extras/f604f4af5f40b612c426e4ca79634770.avif?t=1741888898\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Economic Model:</strong> Experience the real-world challenges of balancing economic growth with inflation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Gameplay:</strong> Easy-to-understand controls make it accessible to players of all levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Visualizations:</strong> Track key economic indicators with clear and informative graphs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Government Response:</strong> The government implements fiscal policy measures (e.g., spending, taxation) in response to economic conditions, adding another layer of complexity and realism to the simulation.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In The Monetary Lever, you're the Bank of England Governor. Control interest rates and QE to guide the UK economy. Balance growth with inflation and navigate unexpected challenges. Test your economic skills in this engaging simulator. Can you steer the economy towards prosperity?&quot;",
